# ChopChop POS — environment secrets (brief §9: never hardcode, never ship service-role key).
#
# Phase 1 prototype runs entirely on seeded dummy data in the browser (localStorage +
# BroadcastChannel), so NO Supabase credentials are required to run the demo.
#
# These are placeholders for Phase 1.5 when the real Supabase backend is wired in.
# Only the anon (public) key is ever exposed to the client — the service-role key
# must live server-side only and must never appear in this file or the bundle.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
